Package: @PACKAGE@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Mikai local QA build <noreply@localhost>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Section: video
Priority: optional
Description: Unofficial desktop client for the Mikai anime catalogue
 Mikai browses the public Mikai catalogue and plays provider streams or local
 files through libmpv. Anime4K shader presets and a frame-comparison workspace
 are optional; ordinary playback does not need AI components.
 .
 This package carries its own Qt 6.12 runtime under /opt/mikai because no
 current distribution ships that Qt version, and uses the distribution's
 libmpv for playback. Optional native inference components are not included.
